001: """
002: ARC unified helper library (single file, canonical APIs).
003: 
004: This module is the single shared helper surface that *all* solver examples should
005: use (ARC-2 and migrated ARC-1 seeds), so they can appear together in one prompt
006: without API confusion.
007: 
008: ## Conventions (non-negotiable)
009: - Grid shape: `grid.shape == (H, W)` meaning `(rows, cols)`.
010: - Indexing: always `grid[r, c]`.
011: - Coords: always `(r, c)`.
012: - BBox: `(r0, c0, r1, c1)` inclusive.
013: """
014: 
015: from __future__ import annotations
016: 
017: import math
018: import random
019: import itertools
020: import warnings
021: from collections import Counter
022: from typing import Iterable, Iterator, Sequence
